At Gateway Kids, we are passionate about training up the next generation to lead, love, and serve Jesus! We strive to come alongside parents to help disciple their children at home while pointing them to Jesus whenever they are here.

Sunday Morning Schedule

We offer two opportunities for your kids to grow in their faith every Sunday morning:
• Sunday School (9:00 AM – 10:00 AM): Age-specific classes focused on foundational Bible learning, crafts, games, and fellowship.
• Kids Church (10:30 AM - 12:00 PM): An engaging, Gospel-centered environment where your child will experience God’s Word through worship, games, and crafts.
It is our desire for every child to understand the good news of Jesus from a young age!

Safety & Check-In

We take the safety of your kids seriously. Every member serving in Gateway Kids has completed a thorough background check and Ministry Safe Training. If you are visiting for the first time, we would love for you to arrive a few minutes early to get your children checked in, see their classrooms, and meet their teachers!
